OTP 25 erts 13.2.2.5

legend: three variants of the PRIVATE function, columns  off | on | wrap:
  off  = private function unguarded              (the 'narrow' scope)
  on   = private function carries the same guard  (the 'widen' scope)
  wrap = private function unguarded, but a fun handed out of it is a guarded wrapper (escape-site guard)
  ok:V is a value RETURNED with no error (the silent case). Cells are cut at 40 characters.
  The exported function is guarded in every variant, as bs_emit emits it on an exported parameter.

